  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.57 “Surface water” means water that is open to the atmosphere and subject to surface runoff.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14; renumbered by #10770 (from Env-Dw 103.55); renumbered by #12180 (from Env-Dw 103.56)",
